# Runtime bind mount created by docker compose (UMS_APP_DATA_HOST defaults
# to ./data/ums -> /var/lib/ums): export artifacts + connector blobs. Never
# commit — revenue payloads and large generated binaries land here as soon
# as the stack runs. Anchored to the repo root so nested source dirs named
# data/ elsewhere stay trackable.
/data/

